#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/index.rst:53
msgid "候选结构清洗后再进入 DFT"
msgstr "Clean Candidate Structures Before DFT"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/index.rst:53
msgid "从训练误差定位下一轮数据缺口"
msgstr "Find the next data gap from training errors"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/index.rst:53
msgid "组织多轮数据和模型版本"
msgstr "Manage data and model versions across iterations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/index.rst:2
#: 16c720ad88f545148f0482c47c2c4f7f
msgid "工作流"
msgstr "Workflows"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/index.rst:4
#: 4cbc1eb774804514b3b3267ad3bc616d
msgid ""
"这里的页面按真实任务组织，而不是按按钮组织。按钮细节可以查模块参考；工作流页"
"只回答： 数据从哪里来，在哪一步该判断什么，最后输出给谁。"
msgstr ""
"These pages are organized by real tasks rather than toolbar buttons. Use the "
"module reference for individual controls; use workflow pages to understand "
"where data comes from, what to decide at each stage, and where the result "
"goes next."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/index.rst:7
#: 60c7618ffb5a42ac9a02036b11433506
msgid "三条工作流分别对应“训练前、训练后和跨轮次管理”："
msgstr "The three workflows cover work before training, work after training, and management across iterations:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/index.rst:12
#: be31f3a45d25414f90627bca7a7b3fde
msgid "训练前：清洗候选结构"
msgstr "Before training: clean candidate structures"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/index.rst:16
#: 5218f8985f154e9e9daf41e8d09350ea
msgid ""
"已经生成候选池，但还没有送 DFT。先排除明显坏结构，再选择代表样本。 输出通常"
"是 ``candidate_pool_clean.xyz`` 或待标注子集。"
msgstr "You already have a candidate pool, but it has not gone to DFT. Remove clearly bad structures first, then select representative samples. The output is usually ``candidate_pool_clean.xyz`` or a subset ready for labeling."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/index.rst:19
#: 0e08eb978d484ef1a59682a88e48e830
msgid "训练后：从误差找缺口"
msgstr "After training: find gaps from errors"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/index.rst:23
#: cc2cf220ea4043d3a1559eb4dc8eab9e
msgid ""
"已经有训练／测试结果。把最大误差和异常点映射回结构，判断下一轮该补什么数据。 "
"输出通常是复核结构集和下一轮生成目标。"
msgstr "You already have training or test results. Map the largest errors and outliers back to structures, then decide what data to add next. The output is usually a review set and a target list for the next generation round."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/index.rst:26
#: 380b746ec22e44f28927f01933e6c92e
msgid "多轮迭代：管理版本"
msgstr "Across iterations: manage versions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/index.rst:30
#: bf723e4ad6b6462a957e0735a7f10371
msgid ""
"已经开始第二轮及以后。固定数据、模型和报告的对应关系，避免覆盖上一轮结果。 输"
"出是可追溯的轮次目录和记录。"
msgstr "You are starting the second iteration or later. Keep the relationships between data, models, and reports fixed so that earlier results are not overwritten. The output is a traceable iteration directory and record."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/index.rst:33
#: 96fd29248b86433aa535efc7bbe54225
msgid "它们在完整流程中的关系是："
msgstr "Their relationship in the complete workflow is:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/index.rst:35
#: 7f17d85c298a4e61a8d0d06b7fd32daa
msgid ""
"生成候选结构\n"
"     │\n"
"     ▼\n"
"清洗候选结构 ──→ DFT 标注 ──→ GPUMD 训练\n"
"                                   │\n"
"                                   ▼\n"
"                           从训练误差定位缺口\n"
"                                   │\n"
"                                   └──→ 下一轮候选结构\n"
"\n"
"“组织多轮数据和模型版本”贯穿每一轮，记录输入、输出和模型对应关系。"
msgstr "Generate candidate structures\n     │\n     ▼\nClean candidate structures ──→ DFT labeling ──→ GPUMD training\n                                   │\n                                   ▼\n                           Find gaps from training errors\n                                   │\n                                   └──→ Next-round candidate structures\n\n“Manage data and model versions across iterations” applies to every round and records the relationships between inputs, outputs, and models."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/workflows/index.rst:49
#: 20e73e749ab44a6f8cf3944b90131227
msgid ""
"如果你只是看不懂某个按钮或参数，不必从工作流开始，直接进入 :doc:`../module/"
"index`。 如果你要完成一次具体的单步操作，例如能量平移或按索引选结构，进"
"入 :doc:`../example/index`。"
msgstr "If you only need help with a button or parameter, do not start with a workflow; open :doc:`../module/index`. If you need to complete a specific one-step task, such as shifting energies or selecting structures by index, open :doc:`../example/index`."
